# This repo is edited on Windows and deployed on Linux, and some of its files
# are RUN by an interpreter that cares. A shell script with CRLF line endings
# fails with "command not found" on the shebang line, and the hub serves
# mac/install.sh straight from the working tree — so a Windows checkout would
# hand a Mac friend a broken installer. Pin the ones that matter to LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf
capture/*.py text eol=lf
mac/install.sh text eol=lf

# PowerShell is happy with CRLF; leave Windows files alone.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
